msgstr "Gestisci WordPress"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Manage queries"
msgstr "Gestisci le query"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "No cache"
msgstr "Nessuna cache"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid ""
"Note: cache is automatically refreshed on any user pull to refresh action "
"whatever the lifetime set."
msgstr "Nota: la cache viene aggiornata automaticamente a ogni azione di trascinamento per aggiornare dell'utente, indipendentemente dalla durata impostata."

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
