msgid "Sorry, we are unable to fetch any category or post from your WordPress."
msgstr "Spiacenti, non siamo riusciti a recuperare alcuna categoria o post dal tuo WordPress."

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
msgid "Sort by"
msgstr "Ordina per"

#. machine-translated (2026-10), to be reviewed
